  "notes": "Anime Vanguards is a tower defense game from Kitawari. You summon units based on anime characters, place them along the enemy path, and upgrade them during the match to stop waves of enemies and bosses. Between matches you level up and evolve your units, then take them into story stages, raids, challenges and events, either solo or with friends.\n\nCodes in this game mostly give Trait Rerolls, Memoria Shards and Gems. Trait Rerolls are the most useful reward, since a strong trait on your main damage unit makes a big difference in harder stages. New codes usually come out with each update, often along with apology codes when an update is delayed, and they are posted in the Discord announcements channel. Most codes only last until the next update, so redeem them quickly.",
