  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "Why does AnniNextHopefully say I cannot use it?",
      "a": "That code needs you to be level 30. Keep playing story stages to level up, then come back and try it again."
    },
    {
      "q": "What should I spend my Trait Rerolls on?",
      "a": "Put them into your strongest damage unit instead of spreading them across your whole team. One unit with a great trait helps more than several units with average ones."
    },
    {
      "q": "How long does 100thTournament last?",
      "a": "Code sites report it ends around October 2, 2026. Anime Vanguards codes are often removed after the next update, so it is best to redeem new ones on the day they come out."
    }
